{'symbol': 'FLT', 'date': '2022-10-20 16:15:00', 'title': 'FLEETCOR® TO ACQUIRE EUROPEAN WORKFORCE LODGING BUSINESS', 'text': 'ATLANTA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FLEETCOR TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: FLT), A LEADING GLOBAL BUSINESS PAYMENTS COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE ROOMEX, A EUROPEAN WORKFORCE LODGING PROVIDER SERVING THE UK AND GERMAN MARKETS.'}